<p class=3D"MsoNormal">Salam alaikum Siam,<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">Thank you for taking the time to meet with us earlie=
r this afternoon. We wish you the best of luck with your legal matters.&nbs=
p; We apologize for not being able to assist you but as we explained, you r=
equire a lawyer who has knowledge and experience
 with labour law matters, especially for your case against Ontario Tech.&nb=
sp; With that in mind, we would like to refer you to
<i>Champ Law Office.</i> The referral is for any lawyers at <i>Champ Law.</=
i>&nbsp; They are knowledgeable and have a lot of experience.&nbsp; Below i=
s the link to the law office:<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><a href=3D"https://champlaw.ca/lawyers/">https://cha=
mplaw.ca/lawyers/</a><o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">The other referral is for <span lang=3D"EN-US">Danie=
l-Tucker Simmons at Avant Law LLP.&nbsp; His email is
<a href=3D"mailto:daniel@avantlaw.ca">daniel@avantlaw.ca</a><o:p></o:p></sp=
an></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">You can also reach out to the <i>Canadian Muslim Law=
yers Association</i>.&nbsp; They have a referral service.&nbsp; You will ne=
ed to fill in the blank: (area of practice - labour law) and the area (loca=
tion -Ontario).<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><a href=3D"https://directory.cmla-acam.ca/">https://=
directory.cmla-acam.ca/</a><o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">With respect to your case in British Columbia, you c=
an reach out to the
<i>CMLA (British Columbia Chapter)</i> and do the same exercise.<o:p></o:p>=
</p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><a href=3D"https://www.cmla-acam.ca/bc-chapter">http=
s://www.cmla-acam.ca/bc-chapter</a><o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">You can also contact the <i>Arab Canadian Lawyers As=
sociation</i>.&nbsp; The link below will bring you to a list of lawyers who=
 practice in the area of employment law.&nbsp; There is a caveat: the list =
of lawyers was prepared post October 7, 2023
 and these are lawyers who will provide their services for employees who ha=
ve been discriminated against
<u>for their support of Palestinian human rights</u>.&nbsp; That said, some=
 of those lawyers may be able to provide you with a free 30-minute consulta=
tion for your legal issues.&nbsp;
<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">chrome-extension://efaidnbmnnnibpcajpcglclefindmkaj/=
https://static1.squarespace.com/static/61db30d12e169a5c45950345/t/6583c6e9a=
9722b646b2d117c/1703134953499/Palestine&#43;Support&#43;Legal&#43;Roster.pd=
f<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">Please let us know if you require additional referra=
ls.&nbsp; <o:p>
</o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">Thank you and good luck in your future endeavours.<o=
:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">Warmest Regards<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">Karine<o:p></o:p></p>
